   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "TWO AI AGENTS. SHIPPED.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 58
  },
  {
   "text": "This horror demo shipped\nwith two AI agent runtimes\ninside it.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.434,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Not one. Two. Plus a\ntokenizer, in a game about\na haunted fort.",
   "start": 4.684,
   "duration": 4.774,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Rudravati, a\nfirst-person Indian horror\nthat went up on Steam\nyesterday.",
   "start": 12.708,
   "duration": 5.035,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Unity on Mono, so the\npackage list is readable.\nIn it: MCP for Unity, and\nUnity's own MCP runtime.",
   "start": 17.993,
   "duration": 7.882,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "MCP is what lets an AI\nagent drive the Unity\neditor. Finding it here\nmeans nobody stripped it\nout.",
   "start": 26.125,
   "duration": 6.472,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Beside them, an inference\nengine with a tokenizer,\nand DirectML.",
   "start": 32.847,
   "duration": 5.192,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
